@startuml
title 视图 3：一次安装与代码所有权
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "feature/rebuild" {
  artifact "protocol.rs\n穷举 Payload" as Protocol
  artifact "install.rs\n唯一映射源" as Install
  artifact "handlers.rs\n同步决策 / 改 State / run" as Handlers
  artifact "workflow.rs\n普通 async fn" as Workflows
}

component "DemoBlueprint::install()" as Blueprint
component "Rebuild HandlerRegistry" as Registry
component "ServiceRuntime" as Runtime
component "RebuildState" as State
component "TaskSet" as TaskSet

Blueprint --> Install : 调用一次
Protocol --> Install
Install --> Registry : Payload type -> handler fn
Runtime --> Registry : 外部消息与 Task 完成消息\n统一按 kind 查表
Registry --> Handlers
Handlers --> State : 普通业务策略
Handlers --> TaskSet : service.run(...)
TaskSet --> Workflows : poll Future
TaskSet --> Runtime : 完成结果转内部 Payload

note bottom of Install
Service 中没有第二个 match
workflow 不注册
新增流程不修改 Runtime
end note
@enduml

